      "match_notes": "<p>Rainhill&nbsp;Won&nbsp;The&nbsp;Toss&nbsp;to&nbsp;put&nbsp;Orrell&nbsp;in&nbsp;and&nbsp;the&nbsp;Openers&nbsp;Mirza&nbsp;58&nbsp;and&nbsp;Baybutt&nbsp;hit&nbsp;30&nbsp;put&nbsp;on&nbsp;69&nbsp;for&nbsp;the&nbsp;1st&nbsp;wkt.&nbsp;Everett&nbsp;Not&nbsp;Out&nbsp;66&nbsp;accelerated&nbsp;the&nbsp;scoring&nbsp;by&nbsp;hitting&nbsp;7&nbsp;Fours&nbsp;in&nbsp;Partnership&nbsp;with&nbsp;his&nbsp;Captain&nbsp;Heeley&nbsp;hit&nbsp;30&nbsp;Not&nbsp;Out&nbsp;to&nbsp;finally&nbsp;declare&nbsp;on&nbsp;247&nbsp;off&nbsp;60&nbsp;overs.&nbsp;There&nbsp;3&nbsp;catches,&nbsp;Ben&nbsp;Edmundson&nbsp;took&nbsp;2&nbsp;and&nbsp;Mike&nbsp;Rotheram&nbsp;took&nbsp;the&nbsp;other&nbsp;and&nbsp;Keeper&nbsp;Simon&nbsp;Brown&nbsp;got&nbsp;a&nbsp;Stumping&nbsp;and&nbsp;Peter&nbsp;Kelly&nbsp;took&nbsp;2&nbsp;wickets.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Despite&nbsp;losing&nbsp;the&nbsp;early&nbsp;wicket&nbsp;of&nbsp;Rotheram&nbsp;for&nbsp;9&nbsp;the&nbsp;score&nbsp;was&nbsp;57&nbsp;for&nbsp;1&nbsp;with&nbsp;Tyler&nbsp;McGladdery&nbsp;1&nbsp;short&nbsp;of&nbsp;his&nbsp;half&nbsp;century.&nbsp;It&nbsp;was&nbsp;Sam&nbsp;Kershaw&nbsp;took&nbsp;over&nbsp;the&nbsp;scoring&nbsp;duties&nbsp;with&nbsp;a&nbsp;fine&nbsp;51&nbsp;Not&nbsp;Out&nbsp;with&nbsp;8&nbsp;Fours.&nbsp;The&nbsp;Home&nbsp;side&nbsp;main&nbsp;aim&nbsp;was&nbsp;to&nbsp;get&nbsp;the&nbsp;150&nbsp;to&nbsp;get&nbsp;2&nbsp;Batting&nbsp;pts&nbsp;which&nbsp;ended&nbsp;in&nbsp;a&nbsp;tame&nbsp;draw.</p>\r\n",
